tDirective  -->\n\nUtilityModule->LetDirective \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    \n    \n    \n        Zoom in\n        Reset\n        Zoom out\n    \n\n  \n\n    \n        \n            \n                \n                    \n                    \n                        17 Modules\n                    \n                \n            \n        \n        \n            \n                \n                    \n                    166 Components\n                \n            \n        \n        \n            \n                \n                    \n                    1 Directive\n                \n            \n        \n        \n            \n                \n                    \n                    113 Injectables\n                \n            \n        \n        \n            \n                \n                    \n                    3 Pipes\n                \n            \n        \n        \n            \n                \n                    \n                    143 Classes\n                \n            \n        \n        \n            \n                \n                    \n                    4 Guards\n                \n            \n        \n        \n            \n                \n                    \n                    253 Interfaces\n                \n            \n        \n    \n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n                   \n    \n         results matching \"\"\n        \n    \n    \n        No results matching \"\"\n    \n\n"},"properties.html":{"url":"properties.html","title":"package-properties - properties","body":"\n                   \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    \n        Properties\n    \n    \n        \n            Version : 7.0.0-beta.1\n        \n            Description : Netgrif Application Engine Frontend project. Project includes angular libraries as base for NAE applications.\n        \n            Keywords : netgrif, application engine, nae, engine, components-core, workflow engine, components, netgrif components, nae components, nae frontend\n        \n            Homepage : https://components.netgrif.com\n        \n            Bugs : https://github.com/netgrif/components/issues\n        \n            License : SEE LICENSE IN LICENSE\n        \n            Repository : https://github.com/netgrif/components.git\n        \n            Author : NETGRIF, s.r.o.\n    \n\n\n\n\n\n                   \n    \n         results matching \"\"\n        \n    \n    \n        No results matching \"\"\n    \n\n"},"miscellaneous/typealiases.html":{"url":"miscellaneous/typealiases.html","title":"miscellaneous-typealiases - typealiases","body":"\n                   \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  Miscellaneous\n  Type aliases\n\n\n\n    Index\n    \n        \n            \n                \n                    \n                        \n                            GeneratorMetadata   (projects/.../generator-metadata.ts)\n                        \n                        \n                            HeaderChangeDescription   (projects/.../header-change-description.ts)\n                        \n                        \n                            HeaderConfiguration   (projects/.../header-search.service.ts)\n                        \n                        \n                            Headers   (projects/.../resource-provider.service.ts)\n                        \n                        \n                            IconStyle   (projects/.../abstract-user-card.component.ts)\n                        \n                        \n                            Mode   (projects/.../abstract-user-card.component.ts)\n                        \n                        \n                            NaeDate   (projects/.../nae-date-type.ts)\n                        \n                        \n                            Params   (projects/.../resource-provider.service.ts)\n                        \n                        \n                            PredicateTreeMetadata   (projects/.../generator-metadata.ts)\n                        \n                        \n                            QuickPanelItem   (projects/.../abstract-quick-panel.component.ts)\n                        \n                        \n                            Resources   (projects/.../schema.ts)\n                        \n                        \n                            ResponseType   (projects/.../resource-provider.service.ts)\n                        \n                        \n                            TaskContentElementType   (projects/.../task-content-element-type.ts)\n                        \n                        \n                            UpdateOnStrategy   (projects/.../update-strategy.ts)\n                        \n                    \n                \n            \n        \n    \n\n\n    projects/netgrif-components-core/src/lib/search/models/persistance/generator-metadata.ts\n    \n    \n        \n            \n                \n                    \n                    GeneratorMetadata\n                \n            \n            \n                \n                    The two nested arrays represent a predicate tree with 3 levels. The root node of the tree is a predicate consisting of a conjunction\n(AND) of its subtrees.\nThe single array represents a predicate tree with 2 levels. The root node of the tree is a predicate consisting of a disjunction (OR) of\nits subtrees.\nThe CategoryGeneratorMetadata represents a predicate tree with 1 level - a leaf node.\n\n                \n            \n            \n                \n                            PredicateTreeMetadata | Array | CategoryGeneratorMetadata\n\n                \n            \n        \n    \n    \n        \n            \n                \n                    \n                    PredicateTreeMetadata\n                \n            \n            \n                \n                    Serialized advanced search filter predicate tree.\nThe nested array represent nested predicate trees with boolean operators.\nThe structure of the tree mirrors the search component.\nThe top level array is a conjunction (AND) of its subtrees.\nThe second level array is a disjunction (OR) of the leaves.\nThe CategoryGeneratorMetadata is a leaf node of the predicate tree containing a single query\ngenerated by AbstractSearchPredicateComponent (and by extension by a Category).\n\n                \n            \n            \n                \n                            Array>\n\n                \n            \n        \n    \n    projects/netgrif-components-core/src/lib/header/models/user-changes/header-change-description.ts\n    \n    \n        \n            \n                \n                    \n                    HeaderChangeDescription\n                \n            \n            \n                \n                            SortChangeDescription | SearchChangeDescription | EditChangeDescription | ModeChangeDescription\n\n                \n            \n        \n    \n    projects/netgrif-components-core/src/lib/search/header-search-service/header-search.service.ts\n    \n    \n        \n            \n                \n                    \n                    HeaderConfiguration\n                \n            \n            \n                \n                        \n\n                \n            \n        \n    \n    projects/netgrif-components-core/src/lib/resources/resource-provider.service.ts\n    \n    \n        \n            \n                \n                    \n                    Headers\n                \n            \n            \n                \n                            HttpHeaders | literal type\n\n                \n            \n        \n    \n    \n        \n            \n                \n                    \n                    Params\n                \n            \n            \n                \n                            HttpParams | ObjectParams\n\n                \n            \n        \n    \n    \n        \